From 30a32ccadc27157b8cac4cb0df396c01967f9001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 09:41:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Read a search's cards in one statement over its stored layout

The pane regrouped a typed search's releases into cards on every read. The
search's read now selects the cards its writes stored: the statement orders
each card's rows by their lead record's year, splits a card that holds two
albums of one catalog into a section for each, and names the card's cover and
the catalogs it lists. A pressing row now keeps the statements its records
made when the row was formed, so the bridge reads them instead of working
them out again.

